{"siren:The pilot appears to have widened access to evening classes, although the headline attendance figure conceals substantial variation between districts. Participants who completed the course reported greater confidence; those who withdrew were not surveyed. Extending the programme may therefore be justified as an access measure, but claims about its educational impact would be premature. A revised evaluation should distinguish participation from sustained learning and include the experiences of those who left.":"117c791baca8326d8cd2bfc33d245b4f7d85150d4c8f3e2dfb44cac2cb7a3f4a","lauren:I needed more time.":"7da62928ad43b3397b5c770f7160be68a9b128b10d767190e3b35a9ad802f165","lauren:The course runs from the fifteenth to the sixteenth.":"f49dcaa2be706fbd18187cf84c213617d5489542e7c6cb76da6c99f4c49b90e9","lauren:The hotel is full on the twenty-first and the twenty-second.":"5a870285381cd0e0e9bd467ab95159e6b92806f17adeddf8166351c0b5dda350"}